Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

OSINT Copilot modifies Tangent by adding an OSINT investigation toolset on
top of the note-writing workspace, and by rebranding the application. The
substantive additions live under new paths and are original work of
Probe Point Analytics LLC:

  apps/tangent-electron/src/osint/**   renderer-side OSINT features
  apps/tangent-electron/src/main/osint/**  main-process services

They include: an entity/connection data model persisted as markdown notes,
an FTM/OIDSF schema system, a Cytoscape entity graph, a timeline, a Leaflet
map, an AI chat agent driving local CLI runtimes, user-authored HTTP
enrichers, and supporting services. That code originates from the
OSINT Copilot plugin for Obsidian, also copyright Probe Point Analytics LLC.

Files belonging to Tangent that have been modified for integration and
rebranding retain their original copyright and are marked in the git
history of this repository.

